  'E-2: ''substantial'' is proportionate to the cost of the enterprise, not a fixed sum', 'No amount is stated and the test is inverse — a cheaper business needs a proportionately HIGHER share invested. Publishing a dollar figure here is the single most tempting fabrication on this route and there is none on the page.',
